letter-eyebrow = INSIDE THE SAFE · AN UNSENT LETTER
letter-title = All those nights with the lamp on
letter-copy = I thought that if I left the lamp on,
    you would know I was waiting.

    Later I learned that love could also mean
    wishing you well somewhere else.

    Take the key. You need not keep
    that summer safe for me any longer.
